id=playintegrityfix
name=mblu21 integrity
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=10000
author=Zhafron
description=TrickyStore keystore attestation plus Play Integrity Fork props for the Meizu mBlu 21. Keeps the keybox already on the device and fetches one only when auto_keybox=1 in /data/adb/tricky_store/integrity.conf.
